# GRAVEL SKY / HELLS ADVENT: Ultimates, Skills, Upgrade System and Skill Trees (REVISED)

**Document status:** DESIGN ONLY. No project files or code were changed.
**Companion to:** `gravel-sky-ultimates-rewrite.md` (the five rewritten ult lines, node renames, no-ult-frame and free-moving-mobs rules).
**Read from the project:** `src/data/talentTreeData.js`, `src/data/ultimates.js`, and the design docs in the project root.

This revision applies the balance review to the original document. The open decisions in Section 9 are now resolved, with the recommended answers built into the rules below.

Values marked **(proposed)** are new and untested. Values marked **(code)** were read from `ultimates.js` or `talentTreeData.js`. Everything else is carried over from the original doc.

