## 3. Skill Rank Track (baseline skills)

The baseline skills follow the same count-based upgrade rule as ults. Ranks arrive at Lv 1 / 15 / 30 / 45 and raise a visible count. Cooldown, radius and stamina scale linearly to the compendium's stated endpoints (for example Lunge cooldown 5.0s → 3.4s, Ground Break radius 110px → 158px). Cells show **count · total ATK**.

**Rule:** every rank must change a visible count. Rank 1 → Rank 4 total growth should land between **×1.4 and ×1.5**. Outliers from the first draft (Rivet Spread ×2.45, Spin Up ×2.3, Lump ×1.3) are retuned below.

