| Sena | Lunge | 1 cut · 160% | 2 cuts · 185% | 3 cuts · 215% | 4 cuts · 240% |
| Sena | Ground Break | 1 shock ring · 140% | 2 rings · 160% | 3 rings · 180% | 4 rings · 200% (stun stays 1.0s) |
| Sena | Rail Parry | 1 crescent · 350% | 2 crescents · 400% (2 × 200%) | 3 crescents · 450% (3 × 150%) | 4 crescents · 500% (4 × 125%) |
| Rook | Rivet Spread | 5 bolts · 300% (60% each) | 6 bolts · 360% (60%) | 7 bolts · 399% (57%) | 8 bolts · 440% (55%) |
| Rook | Kickback | 1 bolt · 200% | 2 bolts · 225% | 3 bolts · 255% | 4 bolts · 280% |
| Rook | Rapid Fire | 4.0s | 4.7s | 5.3s | 6.0s (buff skill: duration is its count) |
| Ines | Pull | 1 pulse · 90% | 2 pulses · 100% | 3 pulses · 115% | 4 pulses · 130% |
| Ines | Spin Up | 3 blades · 60%/s, 5.0s (300%) | 4 blades · 64%/s, 5.4s (346%) | 5 blades · 68%/s, 5.8s (394%) | 6 blades · 72%/s, 6.0s (432%) |
| Ines | Lump | 0 fragments · 250% | 4 fragments · 280% | 6 fragments · 320% | 8 fragments · 360% |
| Kaelen | Naphtha Jet | 1 fire pool · 175% | 2 pools · 200% | 3 pools · 230% | 4 pools · 255% |
| Kaelen | Caustic Mortar | 1 canister · 190% | 2 canisters · 215% | 3 canisters · 245% | 4 canisters · 270% |
| Kaelen | Vent Supernova | 1 ring · 250% | 2 rings · 285% | 3 rings · 320% | 4 rings · 350% |
| Vespera | Tesla Pylon | 1 zap target · 85% | 2 targets · 100% | 3 targets · 115% | 4 targets · 133% |
