## 4. Tree nodes and ultimates

### 4.1 Class-tree capstones

| Class | Capstone | Status | Rewrite / rule |
|-------|----------|--------|----------------|
| Sena | Limitless Echo | **Trimmed** | Ult refunds **35%** of skill cooldowns (was 50%) and gives **+20%** attack speed for 6s (was +30%). Refund timing: at payoff for Tier 1–2 (she is locked in), at cast start for Tier 3–4 (she is free to use the refunded skills during the rain). Target value: about +15% ult-equivalent |
| Ines | Colossus Magnet | Conflict fixed | Ult radius **+15%** (was +25%). Each payoff leaves a 6s magnetized crater that slows enemies 30% (no pull) |
| Kaelen | Hellfire Overdrive | Rewritten for clarity | At the payoff, all current Boiler Pressure vents: +0.1% ult damage per 1% Pressure (max +10%). Pressure resets to 0 |
| Vespera | Satellite Relay (was Orbital Singularity) | Renamed (name clashed with her Tier 1 ult) | Every Vespera ult gains one extra orbital strike on the payoff point (+100% ATK, 0.4s after the payoff) |
| Rook | **Final Count (new)** | **New** | Ult applies Marked for **+4s** longer and refunds **10 charge** if it hits 3 or more enemies. Sits on a new bottom-row node, parented to Kill Zone and Suppression Barrage. Target value: +10–15% ult-equivalent |
| Rook | Dead Eye / Overcharge Battery | No ult interaction by design | Ult bolts do not count toward the "every 8th shot" counter. Dead Eye's guaranteed crit does not apply (ults never crit) |

Why these changes:
- Limitless Echo was worth several hundred % ATK at Lv 45. Satellite Relay is about +14% of a 700% ult and Hellfire is at most +10%.
- Rook was the only class with no ult capstone, and his crit, distance and Clean Mag stats do not apply to ults.
- Final Count must never add crits, distance bonus or Clean Mag.

### 4.2 Class-tree passives: what applies to ults

Based on the `ULTIMATE_CAST_RULES` flags **(code)**: `neverCrit`, `applyAtkBuffs`, `applyMomentum`, `applyMarked`, `applyDistanceBonus`, `applyCleanMag`.

| Source | Applies to ult? | Notes |
|--------|-----------------|-------|
| ATK stats (Iron Grip, Kinetic Orbit, Conductive Coils and similar) | Yes | `applyAtkBuffs: true` |
| Crit chance / crit damage (Keen Edge, Lethal Precision, Precision Overload) | No | `neverCrit: true` |
| Sena Momentum stacks | Yes | `applyMomentum: true` |
| Rook Marked (+20% damage taken) | Yes | `applyMarked: true`. Tier 2+ ults also apply Marked |
| Rook distance bonus / Clean Mag | No | `applyDistanceBonus: false`, `applyCleanMag: false` |
| Bleed Mastery (Hemorrhage) | Yes | Raises the Bleed Sena's ult applies |
| White Heat (Burn +30%) | Yes | Raises Burn applied by Kaelen's ult |
| Execution Doctrine: Culling Blade (+40% below 35% HP) | **Payoff hit only (decided)** | Prevents it multiplying a whole rain or volley. Worth about +20% of total ult damage at most |
| Slag Barrier (shield on skill use) | Yes, once at cast start | Ult counts as one skill use |
| Cooldown reduction (Flow State) | No | Ults use charge |

Each ult's "payoff" must be named in the rewrite doc (for example Eight Cuts: the release hit; Rain of Swords: the Great Sword).

### 4.3 Branch nodes (Journeyman / Master)

The renamed and rewritten master nodes are listed in Part C of `gravel-sky-ultimates-rewrite.md`. How they behave across tiers:

- A master node that modifies the base ult line (Extra Cut, Hold the Line, Floating Yard, Heavy Yard, Crimson Sun, Orbital Ion Grid, Valkyrie Protocol, Slug Round and similar) applies at Tiers 1–2 with its full effect and gives a small rider at Tiers 3–4, so it never becomes dead after Lv 30.
- Master-node count bonuses count toward the Section 2.1 cap (**+4**).
- Anvil / Counterweight (guarding fills ult charge at 2× speed) keeps using `counterweightBlockMultiplier: 2.0`.

### 4.4 Traits (intrinsic and spec)

| Trait | Ult interaction |
|-------|-----------------|
| Intrinsic Rank I–III (Fighting Instinct, Field Awareness, Flux Sense, Pressure Instinct, Circuit Intuition) | Recovery and utility riders: no ult interaction |
| Fighting Instinct Rank IV (guaranteed crit finisher after four varied actions) | Not applied to ult hits (`neverCrit`). The ult cast does count as one "varied action" |
| Spec trait Rank I (Lv 15) | Applies to the Tier 2 ult only if it grants a stat. Otherwise no interaction |
| Spec trait Rank II (Lv 30) | Gives the Sena spec riders in 4.5. Other classes' spec ults already embody their spec |
| Spec trait Rank III (Lv 45) | Adds one conditional rider to the Tier 4 ult (see 4.5 for Sena; others: the existing rank text applies to the ult's payoff) |

