|-----------------------|-------|-------|
| Sena: Rain of Swords | 20 swords → **22** swords, zone +15% | Great Sword +20% damage, +0.3s stun |
| Rook: Rail Slug → Twin Slug | Follow-up blasts 4 → 6, slug +10px wide | Slug damage +20% |
| Rook: Dead Ground | Mines 14 → **16**, zone +15% | Final chain pop +20%, +0.3s stun |
| Rook: Blackout Cascade | Fence spacing +20% (longer fence), EMP radius +15% | EMP +20%, +0.3s stun |
| Ines: Grand Press | Slam radius +15%, each slam leaves a 3s magnet crater | Final slam +20% |
| Ines: Thousand-Knife Typhoon | Shard rings 4 → 6 | Razor wave +20% |
| Ines: Zero-Point Reversal | Polarity pulses 4 → 6 | Inversion burst +20% |
| Kaelen: Crimson Flyover | Lanes 6 → 8 | Crater +20% |
| Kaelen: Cathedral of Iron | Pillars 5 → 7 | Forge press +20% |
| Kaelen: Whiteout Rupture | Blizzard pulses 4 → 6, radius +15% | Shatter +20%, **+2 Brittle stacks (no freeze)** |
| Vespera: Cataclysm Edge | X marks 5 → 7 | Skybolt +20% |
| Vespera: Colossus Directive | Construct radius +15%, longer shock decals | Final slam +20%, +0.3s stun |
| Vespera: Worldstorm Atlas | Ion strikes 6 → 8 | Supercell pillar +20%, +0.3s stun |

Sena's BURST no longer adds +20px radius (it was the only BURST that did). Tier 1 and 2 ults have no fork; their customization comes from branch nodes and the class capstone.

