## 6. Respec and edge cases

| Situation | Behavior |
|-----------|----------|
| Switch specialization | Tier 3–4 ult changes to the new spec's ult (Sena: unchanged line, riders change). The fork choice is cleared. Nodes tied to the old ult are inactive, not lost |
| Level above a tier breakpoint with a missing spec | Defaults to the starting spec's ult (Rail Hunter, Magnet Crusher, Cinder Corsair, Storm Cartographer or Volt Reaver, whichever the character's `Starting Specialization` is) |
| Respec out of a capstone | The ult runs without its rider. No refund of cooldowns in progress |
| Ult cast while Stunned or Lifted | Blocked (`blockedByStatuses: ['stun', 'lifted']`) |
| Charge meter during an ult | Gain is paused for all classes while an ult is active (replaces the per-node `pausedDuringUltimates` list) |
| Two ults requested at once | Not possible. The meter resets on cast |
| Boss and elite staggers | Existing `bossStaggerBase` and per-second stun values still apply to the payoff stun |

