## 9. Decisions (resolved)

| # | Decision | Resolution | Where applied |
|---|----------|------------|---------------|
| 1 | Free ranks vs bought ranks | **Free by level.** Bought ranks would tax Sena and Rook heavily and barely touch Kaelen and Vespera | Section 1 |
| 2 | Cap values | Count **+4**, radius +35%, damage +35% (BURST inside it), stun **+0.6s and ≤ 3.0s**, cooldown **floor 50% of Rank 1** | Section 2.1 |
| 3 | Culling Blade on ults | **Payoff hit only** | Section 4.2 |
| 4 | Charge multipliers | **Normalized** to equal value per charge, plus a per-cast charge cap | Section 7 |
| 5 | Sena spec riders | **Single ult line with riders.** Limitless Echo trimmed, Rook gets Final Count | Sections 4.1, 4.5 |
| 6 | Awakening Mutation timing | **Tier 3 and 4 only.** FIELD redefined as coverage so it matches BURST | Section 4.6 |
| 7 | Do classes share ult animations and effects? | **No.** Each class has a signature (Section 10.2). Shared beat maps, impact kinds, accent colors, pull-ins and openers are banned | Section 10 |

