## 10. Ult animation and VFX identity (new)

**Goal:** a player can tell which class cast an ult from a single frame of the effect, and from the rhythm alone with the sound off. The no-ult-frame rule (Section 2.2) removes the shared cut-in, so the class identity has to come from the ult itself.

Values marked **(code)** were read from `src/data/ultimates.js`. Timings and names marked **(proposed)** are new and untested. Per-ult names follow the Section 4.6 table. Reconcile them with the class identity table in `gravel-sky-ultimates-rewrite.md`, which was not available to me.

