### 10.6 Acceptance test for every ult

- **Mute test:** with the sound off, a tester can name the class from the rhythm alone.
- **Silhouette test:** a still frame at the payoff identifies the class by shape and color.
- **Overlap test:** put the beat maps of every pair of ults side by side. No two different-class ults may match within ±150ms.
- **Same-class test:** a Tier 1, 2, 3 and 4 ult of one class are clearly the same signature.
- **Reduce-flashes test:** the class is still identifiable with flashes reduced.

